{"@type":"Service","name":"Custom kitchen design","serviceType":"Kitchen design and renovation","provider":{"@id":"https://www.renotect.ca/#business"},"areaServed":[{"@type":"City","name":"Toronto"},{"@type":"Place","name":"North York"},{"@type":"Place","name":"Etobicoke"},{"@type":"City","name":"Vaughan"},{"@type":"Place","name":"Greater Toronto Area"}],"url":"https://www.renotect.ca/services/kitchen-design-toronto/"},
{"@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[
{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you work with my contractor or cabinet maker?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Our drawings and selections are prepared so a contractor or cabinet maker can price and build from them."}},
{"@type":"Question","name":"Does a kitchen renovation need a permit?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Replacing cabinets in the same layout usually does not. Moving walls, adding or moving plumbing or gas, or changing the structure usually does. We tell you at the start and prepare the permit drawings if they are needed."}},
{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you remove the wall between my kitchen and dining room?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Often, yes. If the wall is load-bearing, it needs a beam and a structural design, and in Toronto that work needs a building permit. We check this at the consultation and include it in the drawings."}},
{"@type":"Question","name":"How much does kitchen design cost?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"It depends on the size of the kitchen and what is included, from a layout and concept to full drawings, renders and site follow-up. We explain the scope and the fee after the free consultation, before any work starts."}},
{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you design kitchens as part of a larger renovation?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. Many of our kitchens are part of a full-home renovation or a new custom home."}},
{"@type":"Question","name":"Which areas do you serve?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Toronto, including North York and Etobicoke, Vaughan and the rest of the Greater Toronto Area."}}]}
